@remove_konieczny
title: Remove Wojciech Konieczny
subtitle: PPS loses its senate-government liaison figure.
view-if: konieczny_advisor = 1
choose-if: leadership_reshuffle_timer <= 0 and n_advisors > 0 and (advisor_slot_1_locked = 0 or advisor_slot_1 != "konieczny")
unavailable-subtitle: The bureau cannot be changed now, or slot 1 is locked.
on-arrival: konieczny_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1; advisor_reshuffle_removed_konieczny = 1; removed_advisor = "Wojciech Konieczny"; pps_strength -= 2; pps_dissent += 5
go-to: poland_manage_advisors

